# Vectora e2e safety

- Target production admin is `https://admin.govectora.com/`.
- Knowledge base lives under Settings → Knowledge Base. Use it as the source of truth for scenarios.
- NEVER add, edit, archive, or delete records on this domain (or connected portals).
- Tests may navigate, search, open lists, and assert visibility only.
- Opening an Add/Create form to inspect its layout is allowed; leave it via Back/Cancel and assert the record count is unchanged.
- Do not click Save, Confirm, Archive, Delete, Restore, Generate, or bulk actions.
- Do not submit forms and do not fill fields. Login is allowed only to obtain a session.
- Keep the Playwright read-only request guard enabled for mutating HTTP methods, except auth and read-only `/rest/v1/rpc/` calls (Supabase serves reads over POST).
- Generate new cases from live pages via Playwright MCP (`browser_generate_locator`, snapshots) then convert them into `@playwright/test` specs.
- After runs, use HTML (`npm run report`) and Allure (`npm run allure:open`) reports. Optional TestDino MCP is in `.cursor/mcp.testdino.example.json`.
